<title>UK: LIFFE details Nov certified coffee stocks data.</title>
<headline>LIFFE details Nov certified coffee stocks data.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London International Financial Futures and Options Exchange (LIFFE) said on Monday that exchange-certified coffee stocks rose to 2,104 five-tonne lots from 1,410 in October.</p>
<p>Traders have earlier said the stock increase was in line with market expectation.</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks held in LIFFE-nominated warehouses as at last November 30 (in five-tonne lots)-</p>
